## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a CAPA program around operational risk in alert routing, including change control, cross-tenant impact, and measurable containment.

## Key Concepts
- CAPA data model (evidence, lineage, owners)
- Lifecycle with detect/contain/remediate/verify and SLAs
- Canary-based rollback and change control
- Metrics: containment time, recurrence rate, MTTR

## Code Example
```javascript
// Express-like minimal CAPA create endpoint (illustrative)
app.post('/caps', (req, res) => {
  const capa = req.body;
  // persist CAPA with evidence, lineage, owners
  res.status(201).send({ id: 'capa-123', ...capa });
});
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you test the canary rollback plan for alert-rule changes?
- What telemetry would you collect to validate containment and prevent recurrence?

